%% Parcel lifecycle (M4). Source of truth: services/parcel-service/.../domain/state/ParcelStates.java.
%% Any other transition is refused with 422 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED: customer books / merchant order (quote accepted)
  CREATED --> PICKED_UP: courier collects
  CREATED --> CANCELLED: customer cancels
  PICKED_UP --> IN_TRANSIT: courier
  IN_TRANSIT --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY: courier
  OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED: courier, proof required (name and/or photo)
  OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> FAILED: courier, failure reason required
  FAILED --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY: dispatcher re-attempts (couriers cannot)
  DELIVERED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]

  note right of OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
    Every change: parcel row, history row and
    ParcelStatusChanged (outbox) in one transaction;
    a concurrent update gets 409 PARCEL_MODIFIED.
  end note
